<div class="text-[#7a7a8e]"><span class="text-[#c084fc] font-bold">Mike:</span> “Which one were you looking at?”</div>
<div class="text-[#c9c9da]"><span class="text-green-400 font-bold">Caller:</span> “The black 2024 Tahoe.”</div>
