</div>
<button onclick="playDemo(this,'onwK4e9ZLuTAKqWW03F9','Hey, thanks for calling — this is Mike over at Westside Motors. So you're looking at the Tahoe, the black 2024? Yeah, let me pull that up for you real quick... Okay, I've got it here. Yeah, that one's still available. Are you looking to come by today? I can have it cleaned up and ready for a test drive whenever you get here.')" class="btn-primary w-full py-3 text-sm">▶️ Hear It — Sounds Human</button>
<p class="text-[10px] text-[#5c5c70] mt-3">Real voice · natural dialogue</p>
</div>
<div class="card p-8 text-center" style="border:1px solid #252533;background:#0c0c18;border-radius:16px">
<div class="text-5xl mb-4">📞</div>
